{"id":"5a2d46f83be2796a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md","title":"外在固定点","display":"df-extrinsic-fixed-point — 外在固定点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point","91-df-extrinsic-fp","91-df-external-choice"],"display":"df-extrinsic-fixed-point — 外在固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-extrinsic-fp</span><span>91-df-external-choice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extrinsic-fixed-point — 外在固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d154fdd64209bf0e\" href=\"?note=d154fdd64209bf0e\" title=\"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point\">91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-extrinsic-fixed-point-—-外在固定点-$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}$\">df-extrinsic-fixed-point — 外在固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (强 Kleene 跳跃算子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\)</span> (信息一致固定点类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> (固定点相容关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d154fdd64209bf0e\" href=\"?note=d154fdd64209bf0e\" title=\"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point\">91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_J\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\neg\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_J\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\neg\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}\\)</span>：非内在固定点类</li>\n<li>冲突见证：某个固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 对至少一句作相反指派</li>\n</ul>\n<p>外在固定点的定义：\n“外在”在这里精确表示该固定点与另一个固定点不相容；初始假设可用于构造例子，但不属于定义。</p>\n<p>外在固定点的特点：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>假设依赖</td>\n<td>依赖外在假设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{H}\">\\(\\mathcal{H}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人为选择</td>\n<td>需要人为决定初始假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多样性</td>\n<td>不同假设导致不同固定点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>从任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 直接迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 未必单调，也未必得到一致固定点；必须先验证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 与跳跃算子的相容/起点条件。</p>\n<p>外在固定点的例子：\n<strong>包含真理陈述者</strong>：\n若一个固定点判 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 真而另一个固定点判 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 假，则二者互不相容，因而都不是内在固定点。</p>\n<p>只把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 留作间隙的固定点未必外在；是否外在取决于其全部指派能否与每个固定点合并而不冲突。</p>\n<p>外在固定点的问题：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>选择任意性</td>\n<td>不同假设的选择不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无唯一解</td>\n<td>固定点不唯一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要理由</td>\n<td>需要哲学理由支持选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>外在固定点的哲学考量：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>立场</th>\n<th>对外在固定点的态度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>最小主义</td>\n<td>拒绝外在固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大主义</td>\n<td>可能接受外在固定点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然主义</td>\n<td>偏好内在固定点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解外在固定点的定义</li>\n<li>区分内在与外在固定点</li>\n<li>分析外在假设的选择问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-extrinsic-fixed-point-—-外在固定点-$\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}$","text":"df-extrinsic-fixed-point — 外在固定点 $\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ (固定点相容关系, see [[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extrinsic\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_J\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_{c}(J)\\,\n\\neg\\operatorname{Comp}(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{H}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":2455,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-